  "description": [
    "191 pages : 21 cm",
    "Laugh. Cry. And connect with the humorous and bittersweet life experiences found in God, Girlfriends, & Chocolate, stories written by real women to offer real encouragement to you. Speaker, author, and business owner Gaye Lindfors reflects on experiences that have shaped her life. Several girlfriends join her, describing the joys and challenges of living authentic lives of faith, fully responsive to God{u2019}s love and faithfulness. With each breath you take, word you utter, and connection you make, you're writing a unique story as well. Some days, you appreciate the way the chapter{u2019}s unfolding. Other days, you'd probably give away your last piece of chocolate to assume someone else{u2019}s life story. So, whose story are you writing today? Gaye would humbly suggest . . . your own"
  ],
